mily=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.0\" fill=\"#163a5a\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\">账本</text><text x=\"624.0\" y=\"32.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#68727d\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">下游 · 被谁接走</text><rect x=\"526.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"196.0\" height=\"35.0\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e8f5ec\" stroke=\"#cde9d5\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"536.0\" y=\"61.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.0\" fill=\"#15803d\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\">学生自采样</text><rect x=\"526.0\" y=\"87.0\" width=\"196.0\" height=\"35.0\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e8f5ec\" stroke=\"#cde9d5\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"536.0\" y=\"104.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.0\" fill=\"#15803d\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\">多教师 token 级监督</text><rect x=\"526.0\" y=\"130.0\" width=\"196.0\" height=\"35.0\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e8f5ec\" stroke=\"#cde9d5\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"536.0\" y=\"147.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.0\" fill=\"#15803d\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\">梯度冲突</text><line x1=\"238.0\" y1=\"108.5\" x2=\"271.0\" y2=\"108.5\" stroke=\"#d8d3c6\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><path d=\"M 270.0 104.0 L 270.0 113.0 L 278.0 108.5 Z\" fill=\"#d8d3c6\"/><line x1=\"482.0\" y1=\"108.5\" x2=\"515.0\" y2=\"108.5\" stroke=\"#d8d3c6\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><path d=\"M 514.0 104.0 L 514.0 113.0 L 522.0 108.5 Z\" fill=\"#d8d3c6\"/><text x=\"380.0\" y=\"197.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.0\" fill=\"#68727d\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">故事 story-four-masters · 角色→剧情→概念（stories.json 字段）</text></svg>