 {
  "id": "story-night-shift",
  "title": "夜班的录音机",
  "scene": "入冬后车行接了长活，白天四个师傅轮番上场，举升机从早占到晚。老算心疼电费，买了两台录音机：白天师傅说的话录下来，夜班放给学徒听。可录音里的工单是白天的，学徒夜里拆的却是另一辆车。",
  "roles": [
   {
    "role": "小周",
    "maps_to": "学生模型",
    "duty": "夜里按自己的进度拆车"
   },
   {
    "role": "录音机",
    "maps_to": "异步 rollout 缓存",
    "duty": "保存白天教师的 token 级监督"
   },
   {
    "role": "老算",
    "maps_to": "吞吐/成本约束",
    "duty": "决定白天录多少、夜里放多少"
   },
   {
    "role": "老马",
    "maps_to": "陈旧度检查器",
    "duty": "判断录音是否还对得上今晚的车"
   }
  ],
  "plot": [
   {
    "act": "省电",
    "text": "老算算了一笔账：四个师傅同时在场，举升机一小时要烧三度电；如果白天只留一个师傅说话、其余录音，夜里学徒自己拆、自己听，电费能省一半。他管这叫错峰——异步。"
   },
   {
    "act": "错位",
    "text": "第一晚，小周拆的是事故车的纵梁，录音里陈师傅讲的却是昨天那辆混动车的点火时序。小周照录音调了点火，纵梁纹丝不动。老马说：录音没有错，错的是录音里的车不是今晚的车——陈旧。"
   },
   {
    "act": "上界",
    "text": "老马给录音机加了一个计数器：每条录音标上「录于第几步」。规则是：录音与当前步骤差超过 K 步，就不许放。K 从 2 试到 8，K=2 时电费省得少但车修得快，K=8 时电费省一半但返工率翻倍。老算把 K=4 写进账本——陈旧度上界。"
   },
   {
    "act": "夜班的规矩",
    "text": "夜班最后定下三条：录音必须标步骤；超过 K 步的录音只做参考不做监督；每早老马抽查三条录音，对不上就整批作废。小周说：夜班不是偷懒，是把「师傅在场」换成「师傅的话在场」，但话必须对得上车。"
   }
  ],
  "mapping": [
   {
    "concept": "异步蒸馏",
    "entity": "白天录音、夜里播放"
   },
   {
    "concept": "陈旧 rollout",
    "entity": "录音里的车不是今晚的车"
   },
   {
    "concept": "陈旧度上界 K",
    "entity": "录音与当前步骤的差"
   },
   {
    "concept": "吞吐与返工率的权衡",
    "entity": "电费省一半 vs 返工率翻倍"
   }
  ],
  "boundaries": [
   "真实异步蒸馏的陈旧度按梯度步计，不是按「拆车步骤」计；故事里的 K 是离散的，真实 K 是连续的时间窗。",
   "录音是单向的，真实教师可以在任意 token 上给分布；故事把「分布」压成了「一句话」。",
   "夜班没有考虑教师本身的错误——录音里的师傅也可能说错，故事只讨论了「过期」。"
  ],
  "covers": [
   "ch12",
   "ch10",
   "ch11"
  ],
  "long_html": "<!--VIS:story-story-night-shift:start--><figure class=\"figure diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 207\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\"><text x=\"136.0\" y=\"32.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#68727d\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">上游 · 站在谁肩上</text><rect x=\"38.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"196.0\" height=\"35.0\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fdf3e3\" stroke=\"#ecd9b8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"48.0\" y=\"61.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.0\" fill=\"#b45309\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\">小周</text><rect x=\"38.0\" y=\"87.0\" width=\"196.0\" height=\"35.0\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fdf3e3\" stroke=\"#ecd9b8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"48.0\" y=\"104.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.0\" fill=\"#b45309\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\">录音机</text><rect x=\"38.0\" y=\"130.0\" width=\"196.0\" height=\"35.0\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fdf3e3\" stroke=\"#ecd9b8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"48.0\" y=\"147.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.0\" fill=\"#b45309\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\">老算</text><text x=\"380.0\" y=\"32.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#68727d\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">本文</text><rect x=\"282.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"196.0\" height=\"35.0\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e9eff5\" stroke=\"#d6e2ec\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"292.0\" y=\"61.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.0\" fill=\"#163a5a\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\">省电、错位、上界、夜班的规矩</text><text x=\"624.0\" y=\"32.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#68727d\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">下游 · 被谁接走</text><rect x=\"526.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"196.0\" height=\"35.0\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e8f5ec\" stroke=\"#cde9d5\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"536.0\" y=\"61.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.0\" fill=\"#15803d\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\">异步蒸馏</text><rect x=\"526.0\" y=\"87.0\" width=\"196.0\" height=\"35.0\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e8f5ec\" stroke=\"#cde9d5\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"536.0\" y=\"104.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.0\" fill=\"#15803d\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\">陈旧 rollout</text><rect x=\"526.0\" y=\"130.0\" width=\"196.0\" height=\"35.0\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e8f5ec\" stroke=\"#cde9d5\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"536.0\" y=\"147.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.0\" fill=\"#15803d\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\">陈旧度上界 K</text><line x1=\"238.0\" y1=\"108.5\" x2=\"271.0\" y2=\"108.5\" stroke=\"#d8d3c6\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><path d=\"M 270.0 104.0 L 270.0 113.0 L 278.0 108.5 Z\" fill=\"#d8d3c6\"/><line x1=\"482.0\" y1=\"108.5\" x2=\"515.0\" y2=\"108.5\" stroke=\"#d8d3c6\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><path d=\"M 514.0 104.0 L 514.0 113.0 L 522.0 108.5 Z\" fill=\"#d8d3c6\"/><text x=\"380.0\" y=\"197.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.0\" fill=\"#68727d\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">故事 story-night-shift · 角色→剧情→概念（stories.json 字段）</text></svg><figcaption>图 1 · 故事地图：左列是三个核心角色（完整角色表见下方），中列是四幕剧情，右列是映射到的技术概念。</figcaption></figure><!--VIS:story-story-night-shift:end-->"
