 {
  "id": "story-dispatch-table",
  "title": "派单员的表格",
  "scene": "阿珍的派单桌上有一张表：横轴是车型，纵轴是故障类型，格子里写着该叫哪位师傅。表是上一任前台留下的，用了七年。小周发现，同一辆车在表上只能落一个格子，可它往往同时坏三样。",
  "roles": [
   {
    "role": "阿珍",
    "maps_to": "路由器",
    "duty": "决定每个 token 该叫哪位师傅"
   },
   {
    "role": "旧表格",
    "maps_to": "样本级路由",
    "duty": "按车型/故障选一个教师"
   },
   {
    "role": "新表格",
    "maps_to": "token 级路由",
    "duty": "按 token 的域归属选教师"
   },
   {
    "role": "红笔",
    "maps_to": "能力差距权重",
    "duty": "学生越不会的地方权重越大"
   }
  ],
  "plot": [
   {
    "act": "一格只能落一个",
    "text": "一辆车同时有电路、发动机、漆面三个毛病，旧表格只能把它归到「发动机组」。阿珍按表派了吴师傅，电路和漆面没人管，车修好一半。小周说：不是师傅不行，是表格太粗——样本级路由。"
   },
   {
    "act": "把格子切开",
    "text": "阿珍把每个格子切成三行：诊断、拆解、装配。诊断行叫最懂症状的师傅，拆解行叫最懂结构的师傅，装配行叫最懂公差的师傅。同一辆车，三个师傅各说一段——token 级路由。"
   },
   {
    "act": "红笔加权",
    "text": "小周发现自己对电路最生，对漆面最熟。阿珍用红笔把「学生不会」的格子圈大：电路格子占三行，漆面格子只占半行。吴师傅说：你这是偏心。阿珍说：不是偏心，是按差距分课——能力差距权重。"
   },
   {
    "act": "表格的边界",
    "text": "新表格用了三个月，阿珍发现两个问题：一是格子边界模糊，有些故障跨三行；二是红笔圈得太大，学生被同一个师傅反复讲同一段，反而学不动。她把红笔改成按周重算，格子边界改成「按 token 归属」而不是「按故障名」。"
   }
  ],
  "mapping": [
   {
    "concept": "样本级路由",
    "entity": "旧表格一格一个师傅"
   },
   {
    "concept": "token 级路由",
    "entity": "格子切成诊断/拆解/装配三行"
   },
   {
    "concept": "能力差距权重",
    "entity": "红笔把不会的格子圈大"
   },
   {
    "concept": "路由坍塌",
    "entity": "红笔太大导致反复讲同一段"
   }
  ],
  "boundaries": [
   "真实路由器的训练信号来自学生与教师的 KL，不是前台的经验；故事里的「红笔」是人工规则。",
   "token 级路由在推理时要跑多个教师，故事里没有算这笔成本。",
   "格子边界在真实模型里是概率的，不是离散的故障名；故事把 soft routing 压成了 hard routing。"
  ],
  "covers": [
   "ch13",
   "ch14",
   "ch15"
  ],
  "long_html": "<!--VIS:story-story-dispatch-table:start--><figure class=\"figure diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 207\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\"><text x=\"136.0\" y=\"32.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#68727d\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">上游 · 站在谁肩上</text><rect x=\"38.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"196.0\" height=\"35.0\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fdf3e3\" stroke=\"#ecd9b8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"48.0\" y=\"61.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.0\" fill=\"#b45309\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\">阿珍</text><rect x=\"38.0\" y=\"87.0\" width=\"196.0\" height=\"35.0\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fdf3e3\" stroke=\"#ecd9b8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"48.0\" y=\"104.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.0\" fill=\"#b45309\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\">旧表格</text><rect x=\"38.0\" y=\"130.0\" width=\"196.0\" height=\"35.0\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fdf3e3\" stroke=\"#ecd9b8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"48.0\" y=\"147.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.0\" fill=\"#b45309\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\">新表格</text><text x=\"380.0\" y=\"32.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#68727d\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">本文</text><rect x=\"282.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"196.0\" height=\"52.0\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e9eff5\" stroke=\"#d6e2ec\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"292.0\" y=\"61.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.0\" fill=\"#163a5a\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\">一格只能落一个、把格子切开、</text><text x=\"292.0\" y=\"78.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.0\" fill=\"#163a5a\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\">红笔加权、表格的边界</text><text x=\"624.0\" y=\"32.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#68727d\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">下游 · 被谁接走</text><rect x=\"526.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"196.0\" height=\"35.0\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e8f5ec\" stroke=\"#cde9d5\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"536.0\" y=\"61.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.0\" fill=\"#15803d\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\">样本级路由</text><rect x=\"526.0\" y=\"87.0\" width=\"196.0\" height=\"35.0\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e8f5ec\" stroke=\"#cde9d5\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"536.0\" y=\"104.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.0\" fill=\"#15803d\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\">token 级路由</text><rect x=\"526.0\" y=\"130.0\" width=\"196.0\" height=\"35.0\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e8f5ec\" stroke=\"#cde9d5\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"536.0\" y=\"147.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.0\" fill=\"#15803d\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"start\">能力差距权重</text><line x1=\"238.0\" y1=\"108.5\" x2=\"271.0\" y2=\"108.5\" stroke=\"#d8d3c6\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><path d=\"M 270.0 104.0 L 270.0 113.0 L 278.0 108.5 Z\" fill=\"#d8d3c6\"/><line x1=\"482.0\" y1=\"108.5\" x2=\"515.0\" y2=\"108.5\" stroke=\"#d8d3c6\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><path d=\"M 514.0 104.0 L 514.0 113.0 L 522.0 108.5 Z\" fill=\"#d8d3c6\"/><text x=\"380.0\" y=\"197.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.0\" fill=\"#68727d\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">故事 story-dispatch-table · 角色→剧情→概念（stories.json 字段）</t